  m_text: "\"These pages whisper of a time long forgotten\u2026 The Codex of Eternia
    \u2014 once the heart of balance \u2014 was shattered by shadow and scattered
    across the lands.\"\n\n\"Seek the fragments, young Archivist. Each page reveals
    the path ahead\u2026 but beware \u2014 the keepers of shadow will not yield them
    easily."
